iew paper rather than a primary model contribution.","evidence_snippet":"\"A Survey of Multimodal Large Language Models in Biomedical Engineering and Healthcare\""},{"record_id":"rec_003264","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract presents a new foundational agent for multi-omics interpretation with explicit reasoning and latent embeddings, but it does not describe a text or language component. It is therefore outside the generative text-bio scope.","evidence_snippet":"\"We introduce BiOmics, a foundational agent that synthesizes multi-omics data\"; \"explicit reasoning space\""}]}
