f LLM-based agents across genomics…”"},{"record_id":"rec_003258","paper_type":"unclear","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"paper_type_unclear","decision_rationale":"The title points to a biomedical foundation model, but the abstract reads like a proposal ('Here I propose to work on...'). That is not enough to confirm a completed primary model paper or foundation-model details.","evidence_snippet":"“Foundation model for biomedical graphs…”; “Here I propose to work on multimodal LLM … foundation model”"},{"record_id":"rec_003259","paper_type":"unclear","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"paper_type_unclear","decision_rationale":"The fragment links LLMs to biological sequence analysis, but it is too incomplete to determine whether this is a primary study, review, or resource. The model and foundation-model status cannot be resolved confidently from the abstract alone.","evidence_snippet":"“Large language models for biological sequence analysis in infectious disease research”"},{"record_id":"rec_003261","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title explicitly says 'a survey,' and the abstract says it comprehensively reviews LLMs in biomedical data analysis. No new generative model is described.","evidence_snippet":"“The large language models on biomedical data analysis: a survey”"}]}
