./data/screening_codex_full_2026-07-06/role_logs/adjudicator/batch_0165.response.txt:1:{"results":[{"record_id":"rec_003255","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"text_bio_bridge_unclear","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly says this is a review of biomedical multimodal data fusion and analysis. It mentions large language and vision models, but not a specific generative text-bio foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"“In this review, we provide a comprehensive overview” and “the success of the large language and vision models”"},{"record_id":"rec_003256","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"text_bio_bridge_unclear","decision_rationale":"The title and fragment read like a general overview of LLMs for bioinformatics rather than a primary model paper. The abstract fragment is too thin to establish a substantive text-bio bridge beyond topical discussion.","evidence_snippet":"“Large language models for bioinformatics” and “LLMs are a type of foundation model”"},{"record_id":"rec_003257","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly states it is a review and a systematic synthesis of LLM-based agents across biology. It discusses existing systems rather than presenting a new generative model.","evidence_snippet":"“In this review, we provide the first systematic synthesis of LLM-based agents across genomics…”"},{"record_id":"rec_003258","paper_type":"unclear","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"paper_type_unclear","decision_rationale":"The title points to a biomedical foundation model, but the abstract reads like a proposal ('Here I propose to work on...'). That is not enough to confirm a completed primary model paper or foundation-model details.","evidence_snippet":"“Foundation model for biomedical graphs…”; “Here I propose to work on multimodal LLM … foundation model”"},{"record_id":"rec_003259","paper_type":"unclear","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"paper_type_unclear","decision_rationale":"The fragment links LLMs to biological sequence analysis, but it is too incomplete to determine whether this is a primary study, review, or resource. The model and foundation-model status cannot be resolved confidently from the abstract alone.","evidence_snippet":"“Large language models for biological sequence analysis in infectious disease research”"},{"record_id":"rec_003261","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title explicitly says 'a survey,' and the abstract says it comprehensively reviews LLMs in biomedical data analysis. No new generative model is described.","evidence_snippet":"“The large language models on biomedical data analysis: a survey”"}]}
